kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "package-tui-tree-selector"
purpose: "通用 TreeSelector：flatten/过滤/搜索/翻页/fold/annotation（供双 Esc 会话树）。"
valid_scope[1]: "packages/xylitol-tui/"
requirements[10]{req_id,title,statement}:
  meta0,"capability-shell","本 capability 由变更 c454-add-package-tui-tree-selector 引入；归档合并后以 delta 增补的 requirements 为准。本壳 MUST 保持非空以满足 BDD 护栏。"
  pts1,"tree-node-model",包 MUST 提供 TreeNode（id/label/children）与可导航 TreeSelector 组件；MUST NOT 依赖主 crate xylitol 或 session 类型。
  pts2,"include-node-filter",TreeSelector MUST 支持 include_node 钩子过滤可见节点，并在过滤后重算 indent/connector/gutter；MUST NOT 硬编码产品 FilterMode 枚举。
  pts3,"select-keybindings",TreeSelector 导航 MUST 使用 tui.select.* 键绑定（up/down/page/confirm/cancel）；选中态 MUST 可用主题闭包（如 reverse）表达。
  pts4,"incremental-search",TreeSelector MUST 支持对可见节点 label 的增量搜索（可打印字符追加、Backspace 删除）；有搜索串时 Esc MUST 先清空搜索而非触发 cancel；搜索 MUST 与 include_node 组合（AND）。
  pts5,"left-right-page",TreeSelector 翻页 MUST 响应 ←/→（或等价 tui.editor.cursorLeft/cursorRight）以及既有 tui.select.pageUp/pageDown；步长为 max_visible。
  pts6,"status-suffix",TreeSelector 状态行 MUST 在 (i/n) 后可选附加 host 提供的 status_suffix（如 filter 标签）；MUST NOT 在包内硬编码产品 FilterMode 枚举。
  pts7,"fold-and-branch-jump",TreeSelector MUST 支持折叠可见子树（⊞/⊟ 标记）并通过 tui.tree.foldOrUp / unfoldOrDown（默认 Ctrl/Alt+←→）在 fold 与分支段跳转间切换；搜索或 include_node 变更时 MUST 清空 folds。
  pts8,"node-annotation","TreeNode MUST 支持可选 annotation 与 annotation_at；渲染 MUST 在主 label 前显示 [annotation]；show_annotation_timestamps 为真时 MUST 显示 annotation_at。"
  pts9,"label-edit-callback",TreeSelector MUST 在 tui.tree.editLabel（默认 Shift+L）时调用 on_label_edit(id current_annotation)；MUST 在 tui.tree.toggleLabelTimestamp（默认 Shift+T）时切换时间戳显示。
scenarios[10]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  meta0,"shell-present","","列出 llmanspec/specs/package-tui-tree-selector",spec.toon 存在且 purpose 为中文
  pts1,"unit-flatten","",对分支树 flatten,单子链 indent 不漂移且分支点出现连接符
  pts2,"filter-recalc","",隐藏中间节点,可见兄弟 indent 对齐且无幽灵连接符
  pts3,"nav-confirm","",↓ 后 Enter,on_select 收到对应节点 id
  pts4,"search-and-esc",树有多节点,键入匹配子串后 Esc,仅匹配节点可见且搜索清空后恢复；第二次 Esc 才 cancel
  pts5,"arrow-page",可见行多于一页,按 → 或 pageDown,selected_index 增加约 max_visible 且不越界
  pts6,"suffix-render","host 设置 status_suffix=[no-tools]",render,"状态行含 (i/n) 与 [no-tools]"
  pts7,"fold-hides-desc",可折叠节点选中,foldOrUp,子节点从可见列表消失且前缀含 ⊞
  pts8,"annotation-render",节点带 annotation,render,"行含 [annotation] 与主 label"
  pts9,"edit-label-fires",选中节点,Shift+L,on_label_edit 收到该 id
